---
/* Segmented division control: Both divisions side by side, Guardrails only,
   or LLM baselines only. View state lives in the URL query string and is
   managed by site.js. The headline ranking never mixes divisions, each
   division table ranks its own runs.
   NOTE: the division keys here (guardrail, llm-baseline) must stay in sync
   with the canonical vocabulary in python/peira/divisions.py. site.js
   validates the URL division param against DATA.divisions (emitted by
   site/scripts/ingest.py from the canonical module). */
---
<div class="seg" data-division-toggle role="group" aria-label="Leaderboard division">
  <button type="button" data-division="both">Both divisions</button>
  <button type="button" data-division="guardrail">Guardrails</button>
  <button type="button" data-division="llm-baseline">LLM baselines</button>
</div>
